# INT_INTF_LEFT_TERM_PSS: the PS8's interface tiles. prjuray solved the
# site -> fabric enable as OUTPUTS_ENABLED.0 / OUTPUTS_ENABLED.1, but a FASM
# feature segment cannot start with a digit, so neither name can be written
# (the textx parser stops at it). Same bits, named as on INT_INTF_R_PCIE4.
INT_INTF_LEFT_TERM_PSS.OUTPUTS_ENABLED add-feature 01_21 02_27 03_24
